","⬇ 下載 PNG 圖片":"⬇ Download PNG picture","💬 放進對話 PNG 圖片":"💬 Put the PNG picture into the conversation","⬇ 下載 SVG 檔":"⬇ Download SVG file","💬 放進對話 SVG 檔":"💬 Put the SVG file into the conversation","⬇ 下載 專案（JSON）":"⬇ Download project (JSON)","🖍 SVG 編輯器":"🖍 SVG editor","🖼 畫面":"🖼 Canvas","🧩 原始碼":"🧩 Source","▶ 套用原始碼":"▶ Apply the source","↻ 重新產生":"↻ Regenerate","沒有改動":"No changes","已套用":"Applied","整張圖的 SVG。改完按「套用原始碼」：最上層的每個元素會變成一個物件（名字從 data-name／id 來；用形狀工具畫的形狀會變成「圖形」物件）。":'The whole drawing as one SVG. Press "Apply the source": every top-level element becomes an object (names come from data-name / id; shapes become "drawing" objects).',"畫布（匯出的範圍框，不是邊界）":"Canvas (the frame that is exported, not a boundary)","寬":"Width","高":"Height","背景":"Background","貼合內容":"Fit to the content","填色":"Fill","邊框":"Stroke","邊框粗細":"Stroke width","文字":"Text","字級":"Font size","邊數":"Sides","圓角":"Corner","旋轉":"Rotate","透明度":"Opacity","縮放":"Scale","SVG 內容（改完離開輸入框就會套用）":"SVG content (applied when you leave the box)","✨ 把這張圖變成 SVG":"✨ Turn this picture into SVG","用說的畫：「在中間畫一個紅色的圓」「在太陽的右邊加一朵雲」「把煙囪放到房子上面」「找一張飛機的照片」；也可以貼一張圖進來，我試著把它變成 SVG（向量圖）":'Draw by talking: "a red circle in the middle", "a cloud to the right of the sun", "put the chimney above the house", "find a photo of an airplane"; or paste a picture and I will try to turn it into SVG (a vector drawing)',"我是用語言來畫的概念畫家：你說要畫什麼、放在哪個東西的哪一邊，我就加一個新的物件（形狀、手繪的圖、網路上找的圖片都是物件），可以隨時隱藏、改名、鎖定、移動或刪掉，改錯了按「復原」。畫面沒有邊界，可以加在任何地方；中間的畫面可以拖曳、縮放，⌖ 回到第一個物件（圖片）的中間。貼一張圖進來，我會試著把它變成 SVG：先用程式描出每個顏色的輪廓，再用視覺模型看過、比對，不夠像就重來。也可以直接給網址，或說「找一張…的圖」。":'I am a concept painter led by language: say what to draw and where, relative to which object, and I add a new object (shapes, drawings and pictures found on the web are all objects) that you can hide, rename, lock, move or delete any time; if I got it wrong press Undo. There is no boundary: add anything anywhere; drag and zoom the middle view, ⌖ goes back to the middle of the first object (the picture). Paste a picture and I try to tur